    <section id="tab-overview" class="page-view space-y-10">
      
      <!-- Hero Banner -->
      <div class="river-gradient rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-emerald-500/30 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-80 h-80 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        
        <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4 relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-400/10 border border-emerald-400/30 text-emerald-300 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
            <i data-lucide="compass" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Section 1: Title & Purpose
          </div>
          
          <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white leading-tight">
            Sarawak Hydroelectric Power: <br>
            <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-300 via-teal-200 to-cyan-300">
              Clean Energy, Climate Action & Native Rivers
            </span>
          </h1>

          <p class="text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            Sarawak's rugged topography and heavy tropical monsoons produce some of the highest water discharge volumes on Earth. But does damming the mighty Rajang and Balui rivers create true environmental justice, or merely trade local rainforests for industrial power?
          </p>

          <!-- Elaborated Goal Box -->
          <div class="mt-6 bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-2xl p-5 text-slate-200 space-y-2">
