              <i data-lucide="target" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
              <span>Learning Objective & Meaningful Action Goal</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              <strong>Our Goal:</strong> To critically investigate the physics of hydroelectricity conversion, weigh the massive low-carbon benefits against tropical reservoir methane pulses and indigenous resettlement, and formulate a <strong>just, high-impact policy reflection</strong> that will be submitted directly to our project review repository.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <button onclick="switchTab('tab-physics')" class="bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20">
