        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-4">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i data-lucide="help-circle" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Section 2: The Hook
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-1">Challenge Your Intuition (3 Quick Quizzes)</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Earn up to <strong>+150 XP</strong> for answering!</div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

          <!-- Hook Quiz 1: Mechanism -->
          <div class="bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition">
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase font-bold">Quiz 1: How It Works</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] bg-cyan-950/80 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">+50 XP</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">What actually spins the generator in a hydroelectric dam?</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Think about where the electrical spark originates.</p>
              
              <div class="space-y-2 pt-2" id="q1-btns">
                <button onclick="answerHook(1, 'A')" class="w-full text-left text-xs p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-slate-700 transition">
                  A. Chemical electrolysis triggered by freshwater ions
                </button>
                <button onclick="answerHook(1, 'B')" class="w-full text-left text-xs p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-slate-700 transition">
                  B. Gravitational potential energy converting to kinetic energy on turbine blades
                </button>
                <button onclick="answerHook(1, 'C')" class="w-full text-left text-xs p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-slate-700 transition">
                  C. High-pressure steam boiled by submerged geothermal friction
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="q1-resp" class="mt-4 hidden p-3 rounded-xl text-xs"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hook Quiz 2: Concern -->
          <div class="bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition">
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-amber-400 uppercase font-bold">Quiz 2: The Concern</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300 border border-amber-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">+50 XP</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Why can new tropical dams emit greenhouse gases?</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Hydro is called 'green', but tropical biology has a twist.</p>

              <div class="space-y-2 pt-2" id="q2-btns">
                <button onclick="answerHook(2, 'A')" class="w-full text-left text-xs p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-slate-700 transition">
                  A. Flooded tropical trees rot under anoxic water, belching Methane (CH₄)
                </button>
                <button onclick="answerHook(2, 'B')" class="w-full text-left text-xs p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-slate-700 transition">
                  B. River turbines burn auxiliary diesel oil during peak high-tide
                </button>
                <button onclick="answerHook(2, 'C')" class="w-full text-left text-xs p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-slate-700 transition">
                  C. Concrete spillways react with rainwater to emit CFC gases
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="q2-resp" class="mt-4 hidden p-3 rounded-xl text-xs"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hook Quiz 3: What Do You Think? (Interactive Poll) -->
          <div class="bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition">
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-purple-400 uppercase font-bold">Quiz 3: Your Perspective</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] bg-purple-950/80 text-purple-300 border border-purple-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">+50 XP</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Should Sarawak expand more mega-dams, or pivot to micro-hydro & floating solar?</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Cast your vote to see consensus from fellow learners.</p>

              <div class="space-y-2 pt-2" id="q3-poll-btns">
                <button onclick="votePoll('mega', 32)" class="w-full text-left text-xs p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-purple-950/50 hover:border-purple-500 transition">
                  1. Expand mega-dams for regional power exports
                </button>
                <button onclick="votePoll('hybrid', 58)" class="w-full text-left text-xs p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-purple-950/50 hover:border-purple-500 transition">
                  2. Hybridize: Floating solar on existing dams & run-of-river
                </button>
                <button onclick="votePoll('freeze', 10)" class="w-full text-left text-xs p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-purple-950/50 hover:border-purple-500 transition">
                  3. Total freeze: Leave remaining indigenous rivers pristine
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Poll Live Results (hidden until vote) -->
            <div id="poll-results" class="mt-4 hidden space-y-2 text-xs bg-slate-900 p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-800/40">
              <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-purple-300">Live Learner Sentiment:</div>
              <div>
                <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 mb-0.5"><span>Mega-Dams</span><span>32%</span></div>
