                <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-emerald-400 mb-0.5"><span>Hybrid Floating Solar / Micro-Hydro</span><span class="font-bold">58%</span></div>
                <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full h-1.5"><div class="bg-emerald-400 h-1.5 rounded-full" style="width: 58%"></div></div>
